{
  "case_id": "PORTED-PROBE-SMOKE-26.1.2",
  "title": "26.1.2 完整探针迁移冒烟：抽查 10 条由 1.21.1 迁移而来的命令，确认无 port 破裂（异常/未捕获异常）",
  "version": "26.1.2",
  "target": {
    "type": "existing-feature",
    "ref": "mc-26.1.2-probe-port"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "目的：完整探针(astral_bugfix_probe.js)由 1.21.1 机械迁移到 26.1.2 后，逐条命令的 **API 形态**是否仍然可用。抽查覆盖六类高风险改动：① 注册表读取(itemOf/entityTypeOf：give/anvilbags)② 实体创建(createEntity：truedmg/fensplash)③ 权限(hasGm)④ 命令执行(execP：所有走 runCmd 的相位)⑤ Curios 槽位(railguncd/anvilbags 的筹码槽)⑥ 附件与效果类读/写(blastbonus/komachiread/nancystate/spelltdsetup/guidebook)。判据：每条命令必须打出终态 AP_<TAG>_DONE，且**不得**出现 guard 异常行 AP_<TAG>_EX: 或 Brigadier 的 `threw an exception`(后者是 KubeJS 自身 KubeRuntimeException 逃出 guard 的形态，见 probe 头注释)。本条目不判定产品数值，只判定「探针链路在 26.1.2 上没断」。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe guidebook PB1"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe blastbonus PB2"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe komachiread PB3"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe nancystate PB4"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe railguncd PB5"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe truedmg PB6"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe spelltdsetup PB7"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe fensplash PB8"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 2000
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe anvilbags PB9"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe emeraldtrade PB10"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "筹码槽崩溃回归(2026-09-17)：PB5/PB9 会往 chip 槽放筹码、PB10 装 2★ 绿宝石骰子，两者都会让 chip 槽尺寸从 0 变为 N。Curios 15 下若只调 `getStacks()`(旧写法)，`getCosmeticStacks()` 会停在 0，而 Curios 自身 tick 循环以 `getSlots()` 为界却**无保护地**读 cosmetic 槽 ⇒ 下一步玩家 tick 即抛 `Slot 0 not in valid range - [0,0)` 崩服。故这里留出 3 秒玩家 tick 窗口，再读一次状态：`chipSlots` 与 `chipCosmetic` 必须相等(且已增长)，同时 crash 断言必须为空。"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe readstate PB11"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_PB1_GUIDE:given=1"
